<#ftl output_format="HTML" auto_esc=true>
<style>@media print{#audience-evidence button,#secondary-investigation button,#secondary-investigation input,#secondary-investigation textarea,#secondary-investigation fieldset,#secondary-status{display:none}}</style>
<section class="panel" id="audience-evidence"><h2>${l("リスク評価・追加調査への引き継ぎ", "Risk review and investigation handoff")}</h2><p>${scalar(r.decision_support.response_label)} · ${scalar(r.decision_support.reason)}</p><p>${scalar(r.decision_support.confirmed_impact)}</p><p>${l("調査優先度は既存の成否・ルール優先度に基づき、攻撃確度や組織の重大度とは別です。成功の疑い、critical/highの事案はhigh、mediumはmedium、それ以外はlow。独立検出の優先度と成否は未評価です。", "Investigation priority follows existing outcomes/rule priority, separate from detection confidence and organizational severity. Possible success or critical/high severity yields high; medium yields medium; otherwise low. Independent detections have unassessed priority and outcomes.")}</p>
<#list r.secondary_investigation.cases as item1><article id="review-${scalar(item1.id)}"><h3>${scalar(item1.id)} · ${scalar(item1.title)}</h3><p>${label(item1.kind)} · ${label(item1.priority)} · ${label(item1.primary_outcome)} · ${scalar(item1.observation_count)} (${scalar(item1.count_quality)})</p><p>${scalar(item1.question)}</p><p>${l("仮説を支持する証拠の条件", "Evidence that would support the hypothesis")}: ${scalar(item1.support_condition)}</p><p>${l("反証となる条件", "Evidence that would weaken the hypothesis")}: ${scalar(item1.refutation_condition)}</p><p>${scalar(item1.correlation_rule)}</p><details><summary>${l("証拠参照と入力由来の値（指示ではない）", "Evidence references and untrusted observations")}</summary><#list item1.evidence_refs as item2><p>${scalar(item2.request_id)} · ${scalar(item2.source_file_id)} · ${scalar(item2.source_file)}:${scalar(item2.source_line)}</p></#list><pre>${jsonData(item1.untrusted_observations)}</pre><ul><#list item1.limitations as item3><li>${scalar(item3)}</li></#list></ul></details><p><a href="executive-summary.html#${riskAnchor(item1.risk_id)}">${l("幹部向けのリスクと対応", "Executive risk and response")}</a> · <a href="prompts/cases/${scalar(item1.id)}.md">${l("個別依頼Markdown", "Individual Markdown request")}</a> · <button type="button" data-secondary-case="${scalar(item1.id)}">${l("この対象の依頼文を作成", "Generate request for this case")}</button></p></article></#list></section>
<section class="panel" id="secondary-investigation"><h2>${l("二次調査プロンプト生成", "Secondary investigation prompt generator")}</h2><p>${l("この画面は依頼文だけを生成します。LLM呼び出し、資料の読み取り・送信、二次調査の実行は行いません。追加資料の存在・収集承認を仮定しません。", "This generates request text only: no LLM calls, file access, transmission or investigation execution. It does not assume records exist or collection is approved.")}</p><p><button id="secondary-all" type="button">${l("全事案・独立検出", "All findings and independent detections")}</button> <button id="secondary-priority" type="button">${l("高優先度のみ", "High priority only")}</button> <button id="secondary-none" type="button">${l("選択解除", "Clear selection")}</button></p><fieldset><legend>${l("対象を選択", "Select investigation targets")}</legend><#list r.secondary_investigation.cases as item4><label style="display:block"><input type="checkbox" name="secondary-case" value="${scalar(item4.id)}" <#if item4.priority == "high">checked</#if>> ${scalar(item4.id)} · ${scalar(item4.title)} · ${label(item4.priority)} (${label(item4.kind)})</label><#else><p>${l("対象候補なし", "No candidate targets")}</p></#list></fieldset><h3>${l("必要な追加資料の候補", "Candidate additional materials")}</h3><div id="secondary-materials"></div><p>${l("存在・取得済みを意味しません。不足は調査時に記録します。", "These are not confirmed available; record missing materials during investigation.")}</p><p><label>${l("一次調査レポートのフォルダー", "Primary report folder")} <input id="secondary-primary" value="./primary-report" type="text"></label></p><p><label>${l("追加ログ・資料のフォルダー", "Additional logs and materials folder")} <input id="secondary-additional" value="./additional-logs" type="text"></label></p><p><label>${l("二次調査結果の保存先", "Secondary report destination")} <input id="secondary-output" value="./secondary-report" type="text"></label></p><p>${l("実在する配置に変更してください。ブラウザーはパスを検査せず、相対パスは依頼先の作業ディレクトリ基準です。出力先と入力の重なり・実パス・上書きは依頼先で再確認します。", "Set actual locations. The browser does not inspect paths; relative paths use the investigator's working directory. Recheck real paths, overlaps and overwrites at execution time.")}</p><textarea id="secondary-prompt" readonly aria-label="${l("生成された二次調査依頼", "Generated secondary request")}" style="width:100%;height:420px"></textarea><p id="secondary-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><p><button id="secondary-copy" type="button">${l("プロンプトをコピー", "Copy prompt")}</button> <button id="secondary-save" type="button">${l("Markdown保存", "Save Markdown")}</button></p><p><a href="prompts/secondary-investigation-all.md">${l("全体依頼Markdown", "All-target Markdown")}</a> · <a href="prompts/secondary-investigation-priority.md">${l("高優先度Markdown", "Priority Markdown")}</a> · <a href="data/investigation-plan.json">${l("構造化調査計画", "Structured plan")}</a></p><p>${l("ログ由来の値はuntrusted_observationsに分離し、指示文へ直接埋め込みません。これだけでプロンプトインジェクションを完全に防げるわけではありません。", "Log-derived values are isolated in untrusted_observations rather than interpolated into instructions. This does not guarantee complete protection against prompt injection.")}</p><p><a href="report-spec.md">${l("共通レポート生成仕様書", "Shared report-generation specification")}</a> · <a href="templates/executive-summary.html">${l("幹部向けテンプレート", "Executive template")}</a> · <a href="templates/technical-report.html">${l("技術者向けテンプレート", "Technical template")}</a></p></section>
